                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "I took an intro course with Cohen out of interest and struggled to understand the rambling and cerebral lectures. Even doing all the excessive readings and attending every discussion wasn't enough to help me keep up. If I had a religious background maybe it would've been easier to make the connections, but it was extremely challenging for an intro.",
